232 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (In the ever-evolving terrain of environmental governance, a seminal moment emerged with the introduction of the PFAS Final Rule under Section 8\(a\)\(7\) of the Toxic Substances Control Act \(TSCA\) in October 2023. This landmark regulation served as a pivotal milestone in addressing the complex challenges posed by Per- and Polyfluoroalkyl Substances \(PFAS\).)
