/ActualText (If your business has previously reported section 8\(a\)\(7\) data to EPA through another program \(example CDR/ GHGRP\), check whether EPA has labelled it as "duplicative" in the section 8\(a\)\(7\) rule. If so, you don't need to re-report duplicative information, but you must submit a report including all details required by this data call that haven't been reported to EPA before. For the years 2011 to 2022, report any missing information. )
