/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (Sourcing PFAS data manually within the supply chain is a complex task that may not be feasible without the presence of proper expertise, such as experienced compliance professionals, consultants, or effective tools. Additionally, it's important to note that exemptions provided under this rule are extremely limited, and the majority of businesses involved in handling PFAS substances are required to report their data.)
/E (Sourcing PFAS data manually within the supply chain is a complex task that may not be feasible without the presence of proper expertise, such as experienced compliance professionals, consultants, or effective tools. Additionally, it's important to note that exemptions provided under this rule are extremely limited, and the majority of businesses involved in handling PFAS substances are required to report their data.)
