>>
endobj
404 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Reporting under TSCA Section 8\(a\)\(7\) presents unique hurdles for both importers and manufacturers of articles. Below are the key challenges they confront:)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
405 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (1. Identifying PFAS in Articles: Discerning PFAS presence in imported articles is intricate, especially for complex products or those lacking transparent supply chains.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
406 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (2. Data Collection in the Supply Base: Accurate reporting relies on data from foreign suppliers, often hindered by communication barriers and differing regulations.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
407 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (3. Estimating PFAS Content: Quantifying PFAS amounts within articles is complex, particularly for intricate mixtures or when specific data is elusive.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
408 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (4. Understanding the Reporting Tool: Unfamiliarity with the EPA's online reporting system may lead to errors or delays, posing challenges for companies unaccustomed to such platforms.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
409 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (5. Meeting Deadlines: Tight reporting deadlines add pressure, particularly for companies requiring additional time for comprehensive data gathering and analysis.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
410 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (6. Confidentiality Concerns: Balancing reporting requirements with trade secret protection for PFAS formulations demands meticulous consideration, especially when confidentiality is paramount. Even CBI functionality requires proper substantiation.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
411 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (7. Limited Resources: Smaller enterprises with constrained resources may struggle to allocate personnel and technical expertise for efficient data collection and reporting.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
412 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (8. Staying Updated: Keeping abreast of potential regulatory changes or clarifications demands time and vigilance, requiring companies to stay informed through regular EPA updates.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
