/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Section 17 of the Toxic Substances Control Act \(TSCA\) is a crucial component when it comes to enforcement actions related to non-compliance with PFAS reporting and record-keeping requirements. This section empowers the EPA with a range of tools and authorities to ensure that companies and entities adhere to the regulations set forth under the TSCA framework. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
