>>
endobj
437 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The EPA Administrator may assess civil penalties of up to $37,500 per day/ violation of Section 15 or 409 \(prohibited acts\). )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
438 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (b\))
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [22]
>>
endobj
439 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Each day of non-compliance constitutes a separate violation. The penalty amount considers the nature, severity, and duration of the violation, the violator's ability to pay and potential impact on business operations, any prior violations, and other relevant factors. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
440 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (c\))
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [24]
>>
endobj
441 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The Administrator has the discretion to compromise, modify, or remit assessed penalties.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [19]
>>
endobj
